** AUTHORED TEMPLATE — buffer/ac_gain: small-signal AC response at the VCM bias point.
** The input is DC-biased at VCM with a unit AC stimulus; CL loads the output. Reports the
** low-frequency gain (dB, ~0 for a follower) and the -3 dB bandwidth.
** Class port convention: vdd vout vin ibias vss (ibias source-referenced, see metrics.yaml).
